{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311740","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311740","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1231174001:1":{"text":"기도를 마쳤으니 집으로 돌아갈 시간이야.","source_cn":"祈祷结束，我们该回家了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEDE0CEB3FEBE25B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1231174002:1":{"text":"집에 돌아가면 그물과 낚시 도구를 고치고, 신께서 안개를 걷어주시기를 기다려야지.","source_cn":"回家之后，我们会把渔网和渔具都修补好，等待神明显灵、大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52373107E28720A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231174003:1":{"text":"신들이 할 일은 신들에게 맡기고, 우리는 우리가 해야 할 일을 해야 해.","source_cn":"神明有她掌管的领域，我们也要将自己该做的一切做好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD674BDBAE5E4CC8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:渔夫克林顿":{"text":"어부 클린턴","source":"渔夫克林顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}